---
description: Additive migrations and generated Postman collections
globs: "{database/migrations/**,docs/postman/**}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Migrations and Postman

- Add a new migration for schema changes. Do not edit `database/migrations/2026_05_20_000000_create_community_connect_schema.php`.
- Give new migrations a unique timestamp prefix.
- `docs/postman/**/*.json` is generated. After route or FormRequest changes run `php artisan postman:generate`.
- Do not hand-edit Postman collection JSON.
